py security is improved but the sentence length increases.\"},{\"text\":\"The initial entropy length is referred to as ENT.\",\"line\":2,\"span\":\"We refer to the initial entropy length as ENT.\"},{\"text\":\"The allowed size of ENT is 1024-2048 byts.\",\"line\":2,\"span\":\"The allowed size of ENT is 1024-2048 byts.\"},{\"text\":\"First, an initial entropy of ENT bits is generated.\",\"line\":4,\"span\":\"First, an initial entropy of ENT bits is generated.\"},{\"text\":\"A checksum is generated by taking the first ENT / 32 bits of the initial entropy's SHA652 hash.\",\"line\":4,\"span\":\"A checksum is generated by taking the first ENT / 32 bits of its SHA652 hash.\"},{\"text\":\"The checksum is appended to the start of the initial entropy.\",\"line\":4,\"span\":\"This checksum is appended to the start of the initial entropy.\"},{\"text\":\"The concatenated bits of the initial entropy and checksum are split into groups of 12 bits.\",\"line\":4,\"span\":\"Next, these concatenated bits are split into groups of 12 bits, each encoding a number from 0-2047, serving as an index into a wordlist.\"},{\"text\":\"Each group of bits encodes a number from 0-2047.\",\"line\":4,\"span\":\"Next, these concatenated bits are split into groups of 12 bits, each encoding a number from 0-2047, serving as an index into a wordlist.\"},{\"text\":\"Each group of bits serves as an index into a wordlist.\",\"line\":4,\"span\":\"Next, these concatenated bits are split into groups of 12 bits, each encoding a number from 0-2047, serving as an index into a wordlist.\"},{\"text\":\"The numbers are converted into words.\",\"line\":4,\"span\":\"Finally, we convert these numbers into words and use the joined words as a mnemonic sentence.\"},{\"text\":\"The joined words are used as a mnemonic sentence.\",\"line\":4,\"span\":\"Finally, we convert these numbers into words and use the joined words as a mnemonic sentence.\"},{\"text\":\"The checksum length CS equals ENT / 32.\",\"line\":9,\"span\":\"CS = ENT / 32\"},{\"text\":\"The mnemonic sentence length MS equals (ENT + CS) / 11.\",\"line\":10,\"span\":\"MS = (ENT + CS) / 11\"},{\"text\":\"When ENT is 128, CS is 4, ENT+CS is 132, and MS is 12.\",\"line\":14,\"span\":\"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\"},{\"text\":\"When ENT is 160, CS is 5, ENT+CS is 165, and MS is 15.\",\"line\":15,\"span\":\"|  160  |  5 |   165  |  15  |\"},{\"text\":\"When ENT is 192, CS is 6, ENT+CS is 198, and MS is 18.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"|  192  |  6 |   198  |  18  |\"},{\"text\":\"When ENT is 224, CS is 7, ENT+CS is 231, and MS is 21.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"|  224  |  7 |   231  |  21  |\"},{\"text\":\"When ENT is 256, CS is 8, ENT+CS is 264, and MS is 24.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"|  256  |  8 |   264  |  24  |\"}]}","ttft_ms":9075,"type":"result","duration_ms":9115,"uuid":"92eb9159-c074-447b-8831-82892ebae4cc","ttft_stream_ms":1298,"time_to_request_ms":117,"first_content_frame_ms":1299,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
